# canvas-app: soma-chat
# Dictation over art (Boss, 2026-10-30): a thin rail over an art panel, "MG1 · Press to record"; a tap on the art opens the
# MG1 listening screen (Canvas mg1-*); Send types there, and a failure keeps the words. The real `over`, ArtOverlay,
# dictation(...), ListeningLayer and ListeningRequest, in a fixture: a fictional picture, microphone and MG1, and a stand-in
# for the host's ring. Nothing reaches a device. The rail is Phone C's dictation-mg1.owl, card glass-mg1-* (soma-widgets), once written.
# 1. Over the art; typed.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget typed
expect MG1 · Press to record
nolog fixture dictation open
shot dictation-over-art-cover
# Above the rail, on the clear picture: the whole panel takes the tap, not only the words.
tap 0.2 0.1
log fixture dictation open
expect Listening
expect MG1
expect push the meeting to t
nolog fixture relay
shot mg1-listening-cover card=mg1-listening-cover
tap 0.5 0.3
expect Send this?
expect push the meeting to thursday and send the notes after
expect MG1
nolog fixture relay
shot mg1-heard-cover card=mg1-heard-cover
tap Send
log fixture relay: push the meeting to thursday and send the notes after
expect Typed into Brave on MG1
expect push the meeting to thursday and send the notes after
shot mg1-typed-cover card=mg1-typed-cover
# 2. On its way: no links, the words stay, a tap on the paper does nothing.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget sending
# On the rail's own words this time: they take the tap like the rest of the panel, now they are clear of the status bar.
tap MG1 · Press to record
expect Listening
tap 0.5 0.3
tap Send
expect Typing on MG1
absent Add more
tap 0.5 0.3
expect Typing on MG1
shot mg1-sending-cover card=mg1-sending-cover
# 3. MG1 locked: said so, and the words stay, even after a tap on the paper. Cancel still drops them.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget locked
tap 0.2 0.1
tap 0.5 0.3
tap Send
log fixture relay: push the meeting
expect MG1 is locked. Not typed.
expect push the meeting to thursday
tap 0.5 0.3
expect MG1 is locked. Not typed.
expect push the meeting to thursday
shot mg1-failed-cover card=mg1-failed-cover
tap Cancel
absent push the meeting to thursday
# 4. Nothing heard; no microphone.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget missed
tap 0.2 0.1
tap 0.5 0.3
expect Didn't catch that
expect Try again
shot mg1-missed-cover card=mg1-missed-cover
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget nomic
tap 0.2 0.1
expect Microphone is off
expect Allow
shot mg1-nomic-cover card=mg1-nomic-cover
# 5. Unfolded, every state.
fold open
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget typed
expect MG1 · Press to record
tap 0.1 0.1
expect Listening
shot mg1-listening-unfolded card=mg1-listening-unfolded
tap 0.8 0.3
expect Send this?
shot mg1-heard-unfolded card=mg1-heard-unfolded
tap Send
expect Typed into Brave on MG1
shot mg1-typed-unfolded card=mg1-typed-unfolded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget sending
tap 0.1 0.1
tap 0.8 0.3
tap Send
expect Typing on MG1
shot mg1-sending-unfolded card=mg1-sending-unfolded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget offline
tap 0.1 0.1
tap 0.8 0.3
tap Send
expect MG1 is offline. Not typed.
expect push the meeting to thursday
shot mg1-failed-unfolded card=mg1-failed-unfolded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget missed
tap 0.1 0.1
tap 0.8 0.3
expect Didn't catch that
shot mg1-missed-unfolded card=mg1-missed-unfolded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget nomic
tap 0.1 0.1
expect Microphone is off
shot mg1-nomic-unfolded card=mg1-nomic-unfolded
fold folded
# 6. Any other widget (Boss, 2026-10-30): its tap opens nothing.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget other
tap 0.2 0.1
log dictation is only for the widget in dictation-mg1.owl
nolog fixture dictation open
absent Listening
shot dictation-refused-cover
[phone] After the bundle, with Boss expecting it and MG1 on a text field: Page 2's cat keeps moving under the rail "MG1 · Press to record", bottom right. Tap anywhere on it: the dark MG1 overlay comes up and the ring runs light to red. Say something, tap the paper to stop, tap Send: "Typing on MG1", the words appear at MG1's cursor without Enter, "Typed into <app> on MG1", then it lifts.
[phone] With MG1 locked, then with its receiver off: Send says so, the words stay; Send again once it is back types them once. Nothing reaches an agent.
[phone] The file check on the real engine: a copy of the widget under another file name, over a picture, does nothing when tapped.
[phone] Hold the lock button: the agent's overlay is exactly as before, in its own color, and its Send goes to the agent. Move the cat to another panel: the rail goes with it.
